---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Home — Signal
theme: signal
permalink: /explore/signal/
description: Recruiting and staffing for students starting out and professionals moving on — plus the employers who hire both.
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}

{# ================================================================
   THE SIGNAL — a control room rendered in glass.

   Two ideas drive the layout, and neither survives a plain bento grid:

   1. Depth. Glass is only worth using when there is something behind it, so the
      page has a lit field running the full height and panels float above it at
      three deliberate overlaps — the funnel rail straddles hero/network, the
      metrics strip straddles network/board, and nothing else breaks its row.
   2. Asymmetry. The board is a sticky index column beside one scrolling stack of
      panels of varying width, not a matrix of equal tiles. What you can always
      reach (services, numbers) stays put; what you read through moves.

   Colour is a two-state system throughout: brand green = settled and confirmed,
   amber accent = still moving through a stage.
   ================================================================ #}

{% set stages = [
  { name: "Sourced",      count: 412, weight: 412, state: "moving", note: "Profile in the system, matching against open briefs." },
  { name: "Screened",     count: 196, weight: 196, state: "moving", note: "Interviewed by us, shortlisted against a real brief." },
  { name: "Interviewing", count: 58,  weight: 58,  state: "moving", note: "In conversation with an employer, prep included." },
  { name: "Placed",       count: 24,  weight: 24,  state: "live",   note: "Offer signed. We check in again at ninety days." }
] %}

{# ---------- 1. Hero: the board, live ---------- #}
<section class="relative">
  <div class="section-container pb-10 pt-14 sm:pb-28 sm:pt-20 lg:pt-24">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10">

      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="sig-chip" data-state="live">
          <span class="relative flex h-1.5 w-1.5">
            <span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-brand opacity-70 motion-reduce:animate-none"></span>
            <span class="relative inline-flex h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>
          </span>
          Pipeline online
        </p>

        <h1 class="mt-7 font-display text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink sm:text-6xl lg:text-[4.25rem]">
          686 people are moving
          <span class="text-brand">through the pipeline</span>
          right now.
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/60">
          Not a database of résumés — a live system. Every candidate and every brief
          carries a status, and you can watch it change.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="{{ '/services/job-placement/' | url }}" class="btn-primary">{{ icon("arrow-right", "w-4 h-4") }} Enter the pipeline</a>
          <a href="{{ '/services/recruitment-staffing/' | url }}" class="btn-outline">{{ icon("arrow-right", "w-4 h-4") }} Submit a brief</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      {# The hero's proof: not a stat block, but the last five things that actually
         happened. Nothing argues "live" like names with timestamps. #}
      <div class="glass-card lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="glass-head">
          <span>Latest activity</span>
          <span class="sig-chip" data-state="live">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand"></span> Streaming
          </span>
        </div>
        <div>
          {% for placement in placements.list %}
          {% if loop.index <= 5 %}
          <div class="glass-row flex items-center gap-3 px-5 py-3.5">
            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <p class="truncate text-sm font-medium text-ink">{{ placement.name }}</p>
              <p class="truncate font-mono text-[11px] text-ink/55">{{ placement.role }} · {{ placement.company }}</p>
            </div>
            <span class="sig-chip shrink-0" data-state="{% if placement.status == 'Placed' %}live{% else %}moving{% endif %}">{{ placement.status }}</span>
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <div class="px-5 py-3.5">
          <a href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-xs text-brand transition-all hover:gap-2.5">
            Add yourself to the feed {{ icon("arrow-right", "w-3.5 h-3.5") }}
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {# --- SIGNATURE: the funnel rail. Segment widths are the real headcounts, so the
     shape of the funnel is the data rather than an illustration of it. It straddles
     the boundary into the network section — the first of three deliberate overlaps. --- #}
  <div class="section-container relative z-20 pb-4 sm:absolute sm:inset-x-0 sm:bottom-0 sm:pb-0 sm:translate-y-1/2">
    <div class="rail">
      {% for stage in stages %}
      <div class="rail-seg" data-state="{{ stage.state }}" style="flex-grow: {{ stage.weight }};">
        <span class="font-mono text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight {% if stage.state == 'live' %}text-brand{% else %}text-ink{% endif %} sm:text-3xl">{{ stage.count }}</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase leading-tight tracking-[0.16em] text-ink/55">{{ stage.name }}</span>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- 2. Employer network ---------- #}
<div class="relative sm:[&>section]:pt-28">
  {% set placedAtLayout = "marquee" %}
  {% set placedAtTitle = "Network" %}
  {% set placedAtLead = "Employers currently receiving candidates." %}
  {% include "partials/placed-at.njk" %}
</div>

{# ---------- 3. The board ---------- #}
<section class="relative pb-20 sm:pb-28">

  {# Second overlap: the numbers ride up over the network section's lower edge. #}
  <div class="section-container relative z-20 -mt-10 sm:-mt-12">
    <div class="glass-card grid grid-cols-2 gap-px overflow-hidden lg:grid-cols-4">
      {% for stat in stats.list %}
      <div class="bg-white/[0.02] px-5 py-6 sm:px-7 sm:py-7">
        <p class="font-mono text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand sm:text-4xl"
           data-count-up data-target="{{ stat.value }}" data-suffix="{{ stat.suffix }}">0{{ stat.suffix }}</p>
        <p class="mt-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink/55">{{ stat.label }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-container mt-16 sm:mt-20">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8">

      {# --- Sticky index. Everything you might want to jump to, always in reach. --- #}
      <aside class="lg:col-span-4">
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28 space-y-6">
          <div class="glass-card">
            <div class="glass-head"><span>Services</span></div>
            <div>
              {% for service in services.list %}
              <a href="{{ service.url | url }}" class="glass-row glass-hover group flex items-center gap-3 px-5 py-4">
                <span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.06] text-brand transition-colors group-hover:border-brand/40 group-hover:bg-brand/15">
                  {{ icon(service.icon, "w-4 h-4") }}
                </span>
                <span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate font-display text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">{{ service.title }}</span>
                <span class="shrink-0 text-ink/25 transition-all group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-brand">{{ icon("arrow-right", "w-4 h-4") }}</span>
              </a>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="glass-card">
            <div class="glass-head"><span>What each stage means</span></div>
            <div>
              {% for stage in stages %}
              <div class="glass-row flex items-start gap-3 px-5 py-3.5">
                <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full {% if stage.state == 'live' %}bg-brand{% else %}bg-accent{% endif %}"></span>
                <div class="min-w-0">
                  <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] {% if stage.state == 'live' %}text-brand{% else %}text-accent{% endif %}">{{ stage.name }}</p>
                  <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink/60">{{ stage.note }}</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              {% endfor %}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>

      {# --- The stack. Panels vary in width and read top to bottom. --- #}
      <div class="space-y-6 lg:col-span-8">

        {# Who the pipeline is for — two doors, side by side. #}
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="glass-card px-5 py-6">
            <span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-brand/25 bg-brand/15 text-brand">{{ icon("users", "w-5 h-5") }}</span>
            <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Job seekers</h3>
            <p class="mt-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/60">
              Submit once. From then on you are matched against every open brief that
              fits, and you can see where you stand at each stage.
            </p>
            <a href="{{ '/services/job-placement/' | url }}" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-xs text-brand transition-all hover:gap-2.5">
              Enter the pipeline {{ icon("arrow-right", "w-3.5 h-3.5") }}
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="glass-card px-5 py-6">
            <span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-accent/25 bg-accent/15 text-accent">{{ icon("briefcase", "w-5 h-5") }}</span>
            <h3 class="mt-5 font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Employers</h3>
            <p class="mt-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/60">
              Post a brief and get a shortlist that has already been screened against
              it — not a folder of résumés for you to sort.
            </p>
            <a href="{{ '/services/recruitment-staffing/' | url }}" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-xs text-accent transition-all hover:gap-2.5">
              Submit a brief {{ icon("arrow-right", "w-3.5 h-3.5") }}
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        {# One candidate's full trace — the funnel rail, but for a single person. The
           stage names deliberately match the rail above so the connection is legible. #}
        <div class="glass-card">
          <div class="glass-head">
            <span>Trace · Priya N.</span>
            <span class="sig-chip" data-state="live">Placed in 16 days</span>
          </div>
          <ol>
            {% set trace = [
              { t: "Day 0",  label: "Sourced",      state: "moving", d: "Forty applications out, zero replies back. Profile submitted to the pipeline." },
              { t: "Day 1",  label: "Screened",     state: "moving", d: "Résumé rebuilt around the analytics work she actually wanted to be doing." },
              { t: "Day 6",  label: "Interviewing", state: "moving", d: "Matched to three employers. Two conversations scheduled, both prepped." },
              { t: "Day 16", label: "Placed",       state: "live",   d: "Offer signed at Amazon as a Data Analyst." }
            ] %}
            {% for step in trace %}
            <li class="glass-row flex items-start gap-4 px-5 py-4">
              <span class="mt-1 w-12 shrink-0 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-tight text-ink/50">{{ step.t }}</span>
              <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full {% if step.state == 'live' %}bg-brand{% else %}bg-accent{% endif %}"></span>
              <div class="min-w-0">
                <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] {% if step.state == 'live' %}text-brand{% else %}text-accent{% endif %}">{{ step.label }}</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/70">{{ step.d }}</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ol>
        </div>

        {# The on-ramp, for anyone with no history to trace yet. #}
        <div class="glass-card flex flex-col gap-5 px-5 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:px-7">
          <div class="max-w-lg">
            <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink/55">No history yet?</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug tracking-tight text-ink">Start at the head of the rail.</h3>
            <p class="mt-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/60">
              Our IT Training tracks are the on-ramp. Finish one and you enter the pipeline
              already sourced, with a portfolio behind you.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="{{ '/services/it-training/' | url }}" class="btn-outline shrink-0">See the tracks {{ icon("arrow-right", "w-4 h-4") }}</a>
        </div>

        {# Where the placements land. Bars, because the comparison is the content. #}
        <div class="glass-card">
          <div class="glass-head">
            <span>Sectors</span>
            <span class="normal-case tracking-normal">share of placements</span>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-4 px-5 py-6">
            {% for industry in industries.list %}
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <span class="flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.05] text-ink/50">{{ icon(industry.icon, "w-3.5 h-3.5") }}</span>
              <span class="w-36 shrink-0 truncate text-sm text-ink/80 sm:w-48">{{ industry.name }}</span>
              <span class="meter"><span style="width: {{ industry.share }};"></span></span>
              <span class="w-10 shrink-0 text-right font-mono text-xs text-ink/60">{{ industry.share }}</span>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>

        {# What people said after they came out the other side. #}
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
          {% set excludedHere = ["priya"] %}
          {% for testimonial in testimonials.list %}
            {% if testimonial.slug not in excludedHere and loop.index <= 3 %}
            <div class="glass-card px-5 py-6">
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/75">&ldquo;{{ testimonial.quote }}&rdquo;</p>
              <p class="mt-4 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-tight text-ink/55">
                {{ testimonial.name }} · {{ testimonial.role }}, {{ testimonial.company }}
              </p>
            </div>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- 4. Daylight. The board resolves into an unfrosted, fully lit block —
   the palette inverts because you have come out the other side of the pipeline. ---------- #}
<section class="bg-ink py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="section-container max-w-3xl text-center">
    <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-paper/15 bg-paper/5 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-wide text-paper/70">
      <span class="relative flex h-1.5 w-1.5">
        <span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-brand-dark opacity-70 motion-reduce:animate-none"></span>
        <span class="relative inline-flex h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-dark"></span>
      </span>
      Ready when you are
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-7 font-display text-3xl font-bold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.03em] text-paper sm:text-5xl">
      Your first status update starts with one conversation.
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-lg leading-relaxed text-paper/60">
      Ten minutes on the phone, whether you are job hunting or hiring. We will tell you
      honestly where you would enter the rail.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
      <a href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-paper px-6 py-3.5 font-mono text-sm text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-brand-dark hover:text-paper">
        Get started {{ icon("arrow-right", "w-4 h-4") }}
      </a>
      <a href="{{ site.phoneHref }}" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-paper/25 px-6 py-3.5 font-mono text-sm text-paper transition-colors hover:border-paper/60">
        {{ icon("phone", "w-4 h-4") }} {{ site.phone }}
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/variant-switcher.njk" %}
